<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>GoAddress - Tag - loommii</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/goaddress/</link><description>我的个人技术博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.165.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 16 Jan 2026 01:28:43 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://loommii.github.io/en/tags/goaddress/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Daily Question 197</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_197/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Feb 2025 01:01:24 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_197/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category><description>&lt;p&gt;Will the following code compile?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; m := make(map[string]int)&#10; m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;] = 1&#10; fmt.Println(&amp;amp;m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;])&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;No.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;./prog.go:8:15: invalid operation: cannot take address of m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;] (map index expression of type int)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://go.dev/play/p/4W5-rMuIiYI" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;Run online&lt;/a&gt;&#10;The address of a map element cannot be taken directly.&#10;Once a map expands, the positions of keys and values change, and previously saved addresses become invalid.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/details&gt;</description></item><item><title>Go Daily Question 196</title><link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_196/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 00:52:39 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_196/</guid><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category><category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category><description>&lt;p&gt;Will the following code compile?&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#10;&#10;import &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10; m := make(map[string]int)&#10; fmt.Println(&amp;amp;m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;])&#10;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#10;&lt;details&gt;&#10; &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;No.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;./prog.go:8:15: invalid operation: cannot take address of m[&amp;#34;qcrao&amp;#34;] (map index expression of type int)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://go.dev/play/p/F-dYKNEFmvp" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener noreferrer"&gt;Run online&lt;/a&gt;&#10;The address of a map element cannot be taken directly.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/details&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>